      "content": "it's hard to cherish memories when the reality is just... nothingness. i look around and everything is just a reminder that the only thing that made this place feel alive is gone. it feels kind of stupid, right? like, why am i this devastated over an animal? but it just makes the whole point of being here feel so hollow. like i'm just going through the motions for no reason.",
