    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it just feels like a cruel joke. you spend your life building a home and a life, and then the one thing that actually felt pure and good just disappears. and now i'm just stuck in this shell of a life. what's the point of fighting to keep going when it just leads to this kind of silence? it feels like the world is just a series of losses, and i'm just tired of being the one who has to stay behind and watch it happen.",
